      "@id": "note:1770339705487",
      "@type": "Note",
      "title": "Sidebar Organization — Phase 1 Complete",
      "content": "Implemented Phase 1 of sidebar reorg per UX proposal (Option B flat). Changes: (1) Dropped 'My' prefix from Tasks, Calendar, Notes. (2) Replaced Reminders with Today as first sidebar item. (3) Created /personal/today page — smart daily digest with overdue, schedule, due today, upcoming, recent notes, completed sections. (4) Updated /personal/index.vue redirect to /personal/today. (5) Updated routes.ts ROUTE_PATHS. (6) All routes verified with zero console errors. Files: app-config.jsonld, routes.ts, pages/personal/today.vue, pages/personal/index.vue, pages/personal/tasks.vue, pages/personal/calendar.vue, pages/personal/notes.vue.",
      "type": "decision",
      "tags": [
        "sidebar",
        "ux",
        "phase-1",
        "done"
      ],
      "createdAt": "2026-02-06T01:01:45.487Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-06T01:01:45.487Z"
    },
    {
      "@id": "note:1770339712230",
      "@type": "Note",
      "title": "CalendarItemDialogShell Refactor",
      "content": "Extracted the dialog chrome (header, navigation, title/description editing, properties row, footer) from CalendarItemDialog.vue into a reusable CalendarItemDialogShell.vue component. CalendarItemDialog now passes content via named slots: #header-badges, #properties, default slot (content area), #footer-left, #footer-right. This enables other dialogs (e.g. UnifiedTaskDialog) to reuse the same shell. Files: CalendarItemDialog.vue, CalendarItemDialogShell.vue.",
      "type": "decision",
      "tags": [
        "refactor",
        "dialog",
        "architecture"
      ],
      "createdAt": "2026-02-06T01:01:52.230Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-06T01:01:52.230Z"
