    {
      "@id": "note:1770343800100",
      "@type": "Note",
      "title": "instant-local Adapter — Architecture Decision",
      "content": "Built a local-first InstantDB adapter at app/lib/instant-local/ that provides the same API surface as @instantdb/core with in-memory storage persisted to localStorage. Four files: store.ts (Map-based entity store + links + subscriptions + localStorage persistence), query.ts (InstaQL query engine: where, $in, $ne, $gt/$lt, $like, $isNull, and/or, order, limit/offset, nested associations), tx.ts (Proxy-based tx builder matching db.tx.NS[id].action(data) + processTransactions for create/update/merge/delete/link/unlink), index.ts (createLocalInstantDB factory exposing subscribeQuery, queryOnce, transact, subscribeAuth, auth, id). Plugin at instant.client.ts seeds minimum ECMS data (facilities + facilityMembers). Migration path: swap createLocalInstantDB() with init({appId, schema}) from @instantdb/core, delete instant-local/ dir, zero consumer code changes. Verified on /personal/today, /personal/tasks, /personal/calendar, /personal/notes, /onboarding with 0 console errors.",
      "type": "decision",
      "tags": ["instant-local", "adapter", "architecture", "local-first"],
      "createdAt": "2026-02-06T02:30:00.100Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-06T02:30:00.100Z"
    },
    {
      "@id": "note:1770340368732",
      "@type": "Note",
      "title": "Widget Dashboard Architecture Decision",
      "content": "Customizable full-width grid dashboard replacing hardcoded Today page. Widgets are resizable, reorderable, draggable, hideable. Each widget binds to an InstantDB data source. Grid engine: CSS Grid + @vueuse/core (or vue-grid-layout). Layout persistence: InstantDB settings table. 5 phases: Foundation > Core Widgets > Data Binding > Dashboard Page > Polish. USER handling CalendarItem DB persistence in parallel.",
      "type": "decision",
      "tags": [
        "widget-dashboard",
        "architecture"
      ],
      "createdAt": "2026-02-06T01:12:48.732Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-02-06T01:12:48.732Z"
    }
  ]
